codex
The suggested side orientation exposes another print risk: the top foot starts 6 mm above the bed with a 23.5 mm unsupported projection, and the bottom mounting tongue starts later with a 20 mm projection. Those need a support plan. I also checked the STL bounds and volumes independently; the hook and carrier mass estimates agree closely with the files.

